  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.0436fe0be21d": "The fabricator cell survives and stages another false battle site.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.04bc314284e1": "The causal signature decays into ordinary debris noise.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.05e04c0c8eb9": "Without the signed counter-manifest, the leak reads as criminal fabrication.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.114f24bc154d": "A customs scan exposes the ledger before independent copies exist.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.17f9116dd50f": "The trail cools and opportunists strip the identifying hardware.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.1fc47da4f374": "The ambush cell learns the convoy timing and fortifies the cut.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.39460a20bbe0": "The convoy loss proves the route cannot carry civilian tonnage safely.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.3c07f88af00d": "The false identities remain mixed with lawful belt traffic.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.4008a24e2d42": "The sample window closes before a representative cut is logged.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.47556e806542": "The foundry loses its protected allotment and buys fuel at emergency rates.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.4b6480b52b4d": "The calibrated pocket disperses before a complete draw is recorded.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.4dad7a55b584": "Without the Triton comparison, the Veil sample remains an isolated curiosity.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.592ad1153a75": "A sample that never reaches an independent lab becomes another frontier claim rumor.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.618bd9743f3d": "Lost recorders turn a named loss into untraceable scrap.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.689ae080f8cd": "The field window opens without the assayer or calibrated reference case.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.70e7fee3c449": "The captain escapes with proof that the patrol cannot discriminate targets.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.774538953b6e": "The anomaly model cannot separate gas flow from recent violence.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.81ba1ce8e974": "Losing the empty hulls erases the route capacity you just restored.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.97a93550334f": "The deep-route loss remains a rumor and the wreck maker keeps its legend.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.9961810b9f57": "The claim remains indistinguishable from wreck contamination.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.9ff5e9de0f3f": "The witness disappears and the seizure ledger remains unauthenticated.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.a89c2730721c": "The cutter allocation proceeds on old survey data.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.ada671d37696": "Without the dispatcher, the cleared ships are replaced by another timed ambush.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.b4292ef7cb01": "Without the core, the captain becomes another unexplained kill.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.c1324e456a16": "Loss of custody forces Ceres onto spot-market rations.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.e5d7b07b9a97": "The unverified rush strips the seam without a defensible sample.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.failuretext.f7825d661877": "The claim pays out, but the frontier crew still lacks replacement controls.",
  "loc.src.data.careercontracts.field.name.1f42dff0f2f0": "Recovery Broker Orin Vale",
