  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.203204a65ffa": "Accept a low-risk haul or trade contract, confirm it is TRACKED in Mission Log, then carry the required cargo to the marked station for profit.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.3c68f64fc9b2": "Complete the faction intro selected by the Elroy outcome.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.40868aa6b089": "Use the Empire Seed in a physical Ashfall operation, then review final dispositions.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.4707b181a3d8": "Deploy a drone, then assign the program selected by the Elroy outcome.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.9f57d41056c5": "Complete your faction chain: MTS trade runs, SCN patrol clears, or Free Captain smuggling jobs.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.a7dc2603ae61": "Follow the Elroy outcome to the marked shipyard; buy a tier-two hull.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.c7443faecf93": "Follow the 47-A mass signal, sample the discrepancy, then dock at Helios before the manifest is rewritten.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.de5bd55c68da": "Arm the Kestrel, track a low-risk bounty, and destroy the marked hostile.",
