  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.117059a6cf7b": "A recent loss — cargo still largely intact, if you reach it before the scavengers.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.611337ec4e86": "Drifted here long before the lane was charted. Mostly picked clean; the black box may still read.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.8b8677b0bb58": "Shot to pieces in a fight the sim recorded here. Salvageable, but hot — cut carefully.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.95645f2f8160": "A Concord-flagged hull. Stripping it without a permit is a crime — Concord fines, the Quiet launders.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.blurb.dc579d5d7bf3": "Scattered hull plating. Slim pickings, but nobody will ask questions.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.458544b183de": "Wreck Debris",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.e375c14ee045": "Ancient Derelict",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.eec525acdb04": "Fresh Wreck",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.fa9d01c97860": "Military Wreck",
  "loc.src.data.wreckclasses.field.label.fb945801255f": "Battlefield Wreck",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.4230d3bfb760": "Slow, risky, but the crew tag buys you Concord goodwill.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.blurb.fb6be5d3979d": "Faster credits now — and no witnesses.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.998c7947a8f3": "Tow the pod to a station",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.label.c347a533dabd": "Strip the pod for salvage",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.prompt.69432fdb4d76": "The pod is failing. What do you do?",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.5b5c22a1db5e": "Tether the drifting Silt canisters out of the wreck field and sell the pressurized air.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.6297b416a9ed": "The wreck log fingers a specific raider. Track the marked hostile and put them down.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.9d202a468e7c": "Recover an encrypted courier chip for The Quiet. Ask no questions, get paid.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.bacc0ab80b97": "A single survivor drifts in a failing pod. Haul them to safety — or leave the pod for the scrap.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.dc4c1158ae53": "Recover the freighter data core and deliver it to a station buyer who has been asking questions.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.summary.f0a652aa1c87": "Pull the flight recorder from the wreck and carry it to a station; its log names the attackers.",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.41d12a937541": "They Left a Marker",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.4585265e0832": "The Survivor Pod",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.55d5a40fe8af": "An Off-Book Favor",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.659d9c38065a": "The Missing Manifest",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.6e2d900c2f93": "Loose Silt Canisters",
  "loc.src.data.wreckmissions.field.title.9fb09ad82f2c": "Recover the Black Box",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.description.20e43a725331": "Freight in, scheduled market convoys out. Lane-facing logistics ownership.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.description.5d0cf1e95f93": "A sector garrison that warns of raids and contests them. Produces nothing.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.description.831bcb88f6be": "Ore in, alloys out. Defense modest; upkeep steady.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.0b6ee10ab691": "Deploy and program the branch drone",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.352b4ce03361": "Trade runs",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.45f7b2df2be3": "Secure custody / close by force",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.47d3be7e6f7f": "Complete branch chain count",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.609f5840662d": "Patrol clears",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.84adadb323fc": "Scan target / recover wreck registry",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.9eb39441d04a": "Commit to a live branch intro; missions settles on completion",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.a4b9dcf48b28": "Dock after sample",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.bc60ee4f365a": "Mine / sample yield",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.bff284f2fd86": "Purchase hull",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.d04a80e87a14": "Complete trade / haul",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.label.df17b22f6218": "Smuggling legs",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.21cefbd0d858": "Contact lost. Re-arm the bounty — the board still pays.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.59c719217273": "Shipyard still open. Earn the hull; no soft-lock.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.5ae62005819f": "Plot still free. Deploy any passive asset to continue.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.93def3777523": "Gates unmet or choice deferred. The count continues.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.a36e44bec80d": "Three intros still on the board. Pick one path.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.de063c83bb36": "Manifest still open. Sample again or re-dock Helios.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.f91f1667b880": "Chain interrupted. Re-offer the next proving leg.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.line.fb01f66c3e76": "Board still has honest work. Re-accept the haul.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.objective.117e864fbe07": "Complete a tracked low-risk haul to a marked station.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.objective.324d0514195b": "Follow the Elroy outcome to the marked shipyard; buy a tier-two hull.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.objective.359a61f27637": "Complete the faction intro selected by the Elroy outcome.",
  "loc.src.story.campaign47a.campaigndata.field.objective.7b57a94f570c": "Sample the 47-A mass discrepancy, then dock at Helios.",
